WEBVTT

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:42.190
<i>Hello, hello, to my unseen friends and neighbors!</i>

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:49.750
<i>I am Prof. Matthew Denton, representing the third planet of the solar system.</i>

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>We Earthlings wish to make contact with you!</i>

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:58.330
<i>Please, respond!</i>

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:03.600
<i>Hello, hello, to my unseen friends and neighbors!</i>

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:08.710
We have intercepted an interplanetary communication from an unknown intelligent life form!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.020
Pinpoint the source of the transmission!

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:19.200
Start the invasion immediately!

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.490
Ensure our future resources!

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.450
<i>The neo-technology robot, Heybo!</i>

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:09.200
<i>With mechanisms using the most advanced technology of the century!</i>

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.960
<i>The top 1% AI RC!</i>

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.960
<i>This acclaimed high-grade model is on sale now!</i>

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.380
<i>You are the hero!</i>

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.820
Hero, huh?

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:22.570
Joey.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:23.980
Joey!

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.140
Joey Jones!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:30.560
Hang it up for now. It's about time to go to school, right?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.910
Have a nice day!

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.650
Hey, wait up!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.270
Have some lunch!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.640
Thank you very much!

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:47.750
Don't be late now!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.270
I'm home!

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:16.270
That you, Joey?

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.690
Yeah!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.560
I'm heading out!

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.390
Take care now!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:42.730
Good morning, Joey!

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:48.950
Hi, Lina.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.270
Hey, you free this weekend?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:57.340
The cheerleaders are having a dance party, you see...

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.710
This time we're going together, okay?

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.030
Promise me!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:05.440
B-But on the weekend I have things to do at home...

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:09.170
Man, you always turn me down when I ask you out.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:12.950
You should ask out some guy that's cooler than me...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:13.820
You jerk!

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.380
Hey, Joey!

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:21.650
Get away from Lina right now, Joey!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.950
It's my brother...

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:29.050
Joey... You and us live in different worlds, you see.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.380
Give up on her.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.850
Nick, that's mean!

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.930
Be quiet, Lina.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.270
But I'm the one who...

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.250
I told you to be quiet!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.490
It's okay, Lina.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:39.470
But...

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:41.350
Stop it!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.770
I hate useless punks like you.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:50.950
And I get real annoyed when they hang around my little sister!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.200
I'm not really...

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.000
I can't hear you, Useless!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.670
If you got somethin' to say, then say it nice and loud!

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.760
That's about enough!

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.890
Will... Let go of him.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.310
Psy...

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.400
Got it, Joey? Don't come near my sister again.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:30.820
We're leaving, Lina!

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.130
Joey...

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:41.920
You okay?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.930
Sure. This stuff always happens.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.130
Stand up for yourself, man.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.870
They take advantage of you 'cause you act that way.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:55.610
What can I do? I'm no match for them.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:57.750
And I hate fighting.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:02.060
Thanks.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.140
It'd be awesome if you could put giant wings on it too.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:32.420
Joey Jones!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.470
Y-Yes?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.150
No talking during class.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.020
S-Sorry...

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.520
Okay, that's all for today.

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:47.490
Sorry, Joey.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.630
Don't mind it.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.530
Oh, I'm gonna head over to Prof. Denton's place.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:53.890
Prof. Denton?

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.660
The Professor asked me to buy some stuff for him.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:05.600
Prof. Denton? I bought those parts you asked for.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:07.920
Joey, is that you?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.080
You sure look happy...

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.280
Something happen?

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.660
I did it!

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.920
I <i>finally did it!</i>

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.570
The greatest accomplishment in history!

00:08:18.570 --> 00:08:21.440
This will overturn the common sense of the entire world!

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:22.900
In history?

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:25.490
I was finally successful!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:29.400
I contacted intelligent extraterrestrial life forms!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.530
Really?

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.240
My long research has finally paid off!

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:39.410
I calculated which planets were most likely to contain extraterrestrial life.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:41.130
Research and development,

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:44.910
experimenting again and again with all kinds of different methods and communication devices!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:50.800
Slaving away at the microwave transmitter, failure after failure after failure after failure....

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:55.010
And then I finally did it!

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.820
C-Congratulations!

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.930
Yes, those words are indeed appropriate.

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.550
I must refine it even more...

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.880
And if I can improve it to allow me to communicate freely,

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:09.940
I, as the first human to make contact with extraterrestrial life,

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:15.410
will surely have my name inscribed into the annals of history!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:17.450
Okay!

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.640
I've got to get to my part time job, so I'll be going now.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.780
Why aren't you more excited about this?

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:24.610
Were you even listening to me?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.010
Bye!

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.210
Bye-bye...

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:30.470
Contact with aliens?

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:33.570
I wonder if I'll get to meet an alien before long.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.880
Let's head home.

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:42.620
Hey, Psy...

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.810
Something bothering you?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.220
Will said something this morning.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.600
He said I was useless.

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.780
That's not true.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.990
You try really hard.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:57.560
Working a part time job to support your grandma and yourself...

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.610
And you're pretty good at school, too.

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:03.780
What does that stuck-up rich kid know, anyway?

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:05.620
You're so cool, Psy.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:10.000
But I'm not strong like you are.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.720
Come on now, Joey...

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.170
Them again?

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:21.260
Hey, that's pretty awesome.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.970
It responds to voice commands.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.720
Watch this... Back flip!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:31.260
It's a Heybo.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:35.330
Hey, Nick... Let me try it!

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:38.980
I'm askin' ya!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:39.680
Let go!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:40.740
Why not?

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.780
I said stop it!

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:04.330
That's dangerous! Be more careful!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.650
S-Sorry...

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:16.150
Whatever. My dad'll buy me a new one.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.400
Let's go, guys.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.450
You sure about that?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.490
Yeah. It's useless now, so I don't need it anymore.

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:32.940
He said he didn't need it, right?

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:37.650
So it's okay if I take it, right?

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:40.670
Hey, buddy... That's one of <i>Nick's</i> toys, you know.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.680
And it's totally broken anyway.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.070
All I have to do is fix it.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:50.180
And I'd never be able to buy one like this myself.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:54.970
I'm gonna fix you right up, just you wait.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.800
It's looking pretty good.

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.690
Yeah!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.530
I gave it a name.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:38.610
A name?

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.610
Heroman!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.990
Hero...?

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.820
That's the name of this robot.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.590
Sounds nice, I like it.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.100
Heroman, huh?

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.550
Finished!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:36.340
Heroman...

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:38.590
Go, Heroman!

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:40.470
Get the bad guys!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.170
Punch, kick!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:48.350
Joey, isn't it about time?

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:50.340
Oh, that's right.

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.390
See you later.

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.220
Thanks, Dad.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.330
Sorry about calling you out here like this.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.420
I don't mind.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:40.120
It's raining... That's rare.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:44.020
I might have left the window open!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.520
Oh, no!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.960
Hey, Joey, fill me up! {Stan :) }

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.660
Hey, where are you going?

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.660
Sorry, I'll be right back!

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:08.100
Lina, I heard from Will that you have a friend named Joey.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.040
Yeah...

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:13.630
He doesn't seem to have a very good reputation.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:16.680
There my brother goes again...

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.900
Oh, no! The rain!

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.070
What the...

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.050
What the heck was that?

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.710
This is...

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:12.550
Heroman is... alive!

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.460
Wow, awesome!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:38.230
My Heroman! He's alive!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.230
Heroman?

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:57.580
What? An accident, maybe?

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:01.920
Something the matter, Heroman?

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:13.720
It looks different than before...

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.220
Stop!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:41.210
Please, stop!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.230
What?

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:24.720
That car... Isn't that...

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.610
Lina, Lina!

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:36.840
Lina!

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:44.810
What should I...

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:48.740
Heroman!

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.610
Please, please...

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:55.360
Save Lina, Heroman!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:07.220
Right!

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:12.580
Heroman...

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.810
Go!

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.180
Lina...

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:23.130
Heroman...

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:45.110
Heroman!

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:53.060
You are definitely... my hero!

00:21:55.150 --> 00:22:00.820
<i>Hello, hello, to my unseen friends and neighbors!</i>

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:07.720
<i>I am Prof. Matthew Denton, representing the third planet of the solar system.</i>

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>We Earthlings wish to make contact with you!</i>

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:24.090
<b>"Can you hear this voice?"</b>

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:31.560
<b>I've been calling that, always, from deep within my heart.</b>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:45.460
<b>Would you, all alone, let another lonely one be next to you?</b>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.010
<b>Because together it's not lonely, it's twoly.</b>

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:56.140
<b>See, you're not alone any longer.</b>

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:59.990
<b>Just because there's no one next to me</b>

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>doesn't mean that I'm lonely!</b>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:07.740
<b>For someone to notice this pain</b>

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:13.270
<b>that heart must have surely cried.</b>

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.650
<b>Right now, we'll crush to bits</b>

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:20.350
<b>the fortress of our limitless sadness!</b>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:24.050
<b>I'll take you with me!</b>

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.730
<b>Got it? I'm running through at full power.</b>

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:31.470
<b>To where you're waiting, left behind</b>

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:34.640
<b>in the place of tears...</b>

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>I believe in you, with burning passion!</b>

00:23:50.760 --> 00:23:52.660
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:55.290
Oh, no! Saucers are coming down from the sky!

00:23:55.290 --> 00:23:57.410
Are those... aliens?

00:23:57.410 --> 00:24:00.790
Joey has had his dramatic meeting with Heroman.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:07.250
And waiting for them is an earth invasion by extraterrestrial life forms, the Skrugg!

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:08.840
The responsibility of one who gains power...

00:24:09.140 --> 00:24:11.970
When the time comes, Heroman and Joey will...

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:16.030
Next time, Heroman Episode #2: Encounter!

00:24:16.030 --> 00:24:18.770
Heroman... Attack!
